{
  "Npcs.JellyFishGirl.Desc": "Unlike goo-girls on dry land, this creature's translucent {0} mass is largely concentrated at the top, in an umbrella-shaped bell, surrounding a ruby-red nucleus. Hanging from the bell is a small, cute little miniature woman, whose compact size contrasts the danger of her many sticky tendrils draping around her."
  "Npcs.JellyFishGirl.Name": "jelly-girl"
}
